    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ops_text",
      "x": 697, "y": 192,
      "width": 326, "height": 146,
      "text": "Pipeline = Source → Ops[] → Sink\n\nSOURCE: TableScan (zone-map prune,\n  late-materialize, partition prune)\nOPERATOR: Filter | Projection | JoinProbe\nSINK: Sort | HashAgg | Insert | Delete\n       HashJoinBuild | ResultCollector\n\nDataChunk: 1024 rows × N columns",
      "originalText": "Pipeline = Source → Ops[] → Sink\n\nSOURCE: TableScan (zone-map prune,\n  late-materialize, partition prune)\nOPERATOR: Filter | Projection | JoinProbe\nSINK: Sort | HashAgg | Insert | Delete\n       HashJoinBuild | ResultCollector\n\nDataChunk: 1024 rows × N columns",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
